Planet explorer
---------------
The planet and surface images were rendered by the Browsery developer in Blender
(tools/render/explorer.py) from the planet maps by Solar System Scope / INOVE
(https://www.solarsystemscope.com/textures/), licensed CC BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). The maps were modified
(projection, lighting, atmosphere, colour and compositing).
